{%- comment -%}
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
SNH COLLECTION FILTER BAR
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Drop-in replacement for snippets/facets-vertical.liquid.
Variables: results, show_sort_by, show_filters, update_on_change.

Four bands, in the order a customer actually decides:

  QUICK FIND   one field that narrows the goal and brand rails as you type,
               and offers full product search on Enter
  GOALS        context-aware shortcuts into your real collections. On Whey
               Protein it offers Isolate / Blend / Clear / Casein; on Vitamins
               it offers Multivitamins / Minerals / Omega. Anywhere unmapped it
               falls back to the nine shop-by-goal collections.
  BRANDS       every mark, resolved automatically from <brand-handle>-logo.webp
  CONTROLS     in stock, filter groups, sort — then active filters as chips

Sticky on every device, and it condenses to a single slim band once you scroll,
so it never eats a phone screen.

THE ONLY THING TO EDIT is the goal map below. A collection named there that
does not exist, or holds no products, is skipped silently — so a wrong guess
can never show a dead link.
{%- endcomment -%}

